{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Groupel</strong>, a strategic roguelike where luck is nothing but an illusion\u2026 and chance itself becomes a weapon to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run begins with a handful of chips. Your goal: <strong>survive round after round</strong> by reaching the required target each time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware \u2014 the house doesn\u2019t forgive mistakes. One bad bet, and everything can crumble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between rounds, visit the <strong>croupier\u2019s shop</strong>, a shady yet charming dealer ready to sell you <strong>jokers that can rewrite the rules of the game</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >multiply your winnings, rig the colors, influence the ball\u2019s path, or bend the odds in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own synergy, combine effects, and discover unexpected strategies to defy fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is unique \u2014 new jokers, new challenges, new chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game adapts to your success: the better you do, the higher the stakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll need to <strong>take risks, play with probability, and turn your mistakes into opportunities</strong> to push your luck further than ever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udccf\u00a0Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf A <strong>reimagined roulette gameplay</strong> turned into a strategic roguelike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc8e Over <strong>100 unique jokers</strong> with varied and sometimes absurd effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Endless combinations</strong> to craft your own playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uded2 A <strong>mysterious shop</strong>, filled with shady deals and tempting offers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 A rich <strong>casino atmosphere</strong> \u2014 roulette spins, whispers, and clinking glasses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Progressive difficulty</strong> where fortune favors the bold.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The question isn\u2019t whether you\u2019ll win\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >but <strong>how long you\u2019ll last before luck runs out.</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Stage","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4095030/d6260aa04368127d86069e7ccfcddd5f186cd251.jpg"},{"name":"Stage 5","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4095030/d854568fe006eb3c57be518f45551b5f96db9599.jpg"},{"name":"Stage 10","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4095030/a431e297ec8cc7145e777000cf8de98166f7d88d.jpg"},{"name":"Stage 20","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4095030/fbf227dd2f574b1473a689bf1874f98859363972.jpg"},{"name":"Rich","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4095030/c970a5c73f8486d7bb94edaf9fb4cd185ab3c20d.jpg"},{"name":"Very Rich","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4095030/e73cd2f280d5503019165d2c71f8efbf69733e2f.jpg"},{"name":"Millionaire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4095030/e4209f07893d958ce83b8f984496cfd77c0fb0ee.jpg"},{"name":"Big Win","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4095030/4ff982cd80489e716deacdbbcc30bf35e3cda2e5.jpg"},{"name":"Lucky Seven","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4095030/390d6cec47002231db673d38d8bc40af4d9e196c.jpg"},{"name":"H